{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8b <strong>Toilet Battle Hero</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Lose the match... and maybe a little more.&quot;</strong><br>Welcome to the ultimate game of seduction and chance. In this sizzling twist on the classic Japanese showdown, every round is a gamble\u2014and every loss brings you closer to revealing more than just your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Toilet Battle Hero</i>\u00a0</strong>is a sensual, fast-paced party game that combines the simplicity of rock-paper-scissors with teasing animations and seductive characters. Victory brings you bragging rights\u2014defeat might cost you your dignity (and a layer of clothing).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc84 Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270a Classic rock-paper-scissors, reimagined with heat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc59 A cast of alluring opponents, each with unique personalities and irresistible charm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 Unique stages: Battle across surreal and varied environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc55 Visual stakes: Losers remove clothing\u2014adding tension and humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd13 Unlockable outfits, special scenes, and steamy bonus content as you climb the ranks</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Enter a Building","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3668520/b8d844ebfb1d58b647309b206c505fdd715b0baa.jpg"},{"name":"To warm up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3668520/6abae931f0b827f8b9562b6dc804c36e02cde3bf.jpg"},{"name":"Enter the Toilet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3668520/54dc35ce5900a977d